---
import { Body, Article, Image, Footer } from "#lib/elements";
import { Background, Navigation } from "#lib/components";
import { aura_png } from "#lib/assets";
import { IMG_0811 } from "#lib/assets/about";

const SITE_TITLE = "ABOUT | BRICK WALL ZINE";
const SITE_DESCRIPTION = "";
---

<Body title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
	<div class="page">
		<Background image={aura_png} repeat />

		<header>
			<Navigation />
		</header>

		<main>
			<Article>
				<Image src={IMG_0811} />

				<p>
					Brick Wall Magazine was created in 2026 to explore current and past culture, art and fashion zeitgeists.
					Started by us, Scarlet Somerville and Kalypso Isaidou, Brick Wall began as a passion project to keep us inspired and keep us creating content after finishing our roles as Editors of Hard Magazine based in York.
					We love keeping posted on fashion takes, film tastes and latest topics of interest across internet culture.
					Fuelled by busy city scenes, graffiti on every wall, kitten heels, catwalks, and coffee queues, Brick Wall is about all the small details that make experiences special.
					We started as two girls who love to take pictures, write down every note and read every hot take.
					Now we're two girls building a magazine for those looking for their next best read on their way to work, on their cafe morning or on their bed under the covers.
					Currently Brick Wall Magazine is working online and soon to be open for submissions for print issues.
				</p>
			</Article>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</div>
</Body>

<style>
	.page {
		position: relative;
		min-height: 100svh;
	}

	@media (width < 900px) {
		.content {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column-reverse;
		}
	}
</style>
